<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>m0leCon CTF on 7Rocky's Blog. Cybersecurity and Maths</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/m0lecon-ctf/</link><description>Recent content in m0leCon CTF on 7Rocky's Blog. Cybersecurity and Maths</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>Licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><atom:link href="https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/m0lecon-ctf/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Sweep</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/m0lecon-ctf/go-sweep/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/m0lecon-ctf/go-sweep/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We are given a binary called &lt;code&gt;GoSweep&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;
 &lt;code class="ma0 pa0 white"&gt;
 &lt;pre class="cconsole" tabindex="0"&gt;
&lt;span class="code-cyan"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="code-dark-green"&gt;file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mtku"&gt;GoSweep&lt;/span&gt;
GoSweep: ELF 64-bit LSB executable, x86-64, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2, Go BuildID=E8AKvGNouZccNMS4QzKx/gv5u3Bl0aF1q0beXnu2L/ZgB_HzVs3SKcdMITee5O/W5Hg19NTpamr0Is20WCh, stripped
&lt;/pre&gt;
 &lt;/code&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The binary runs a web server to play minesweeper. We have a nice UI on the remote URL:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://7rocky.github.io/images/other/m0leCon%20CTF/Go-Sweep-1.webp" alt="Go Sweep 1"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is a stripped binary compiled from Go, so it will be a bit hard to reverse-engineer. It is worth mentioning that this challenge was categorized as Reversing/Web, although I think it fits better in the Reversing side.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Quadratic Leak</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/m0lecon-ctf/quadratic-leak/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/m0lecon-ctf/quadratic-leak/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We are given the Python source code to encrypt the flag:&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;
 &lt;code class="ma0 pa0 white"&gt;
 &lt;pre class="ccode" tabindex="0"&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;Crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;PublicKey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;RSA&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;Crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;Util&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;long_to_bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;bytes_to_long&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;flag&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'ptm{REDACTED}'&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;flag&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;bytes_to_long&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;flag&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;RSA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;generate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;2048&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;q&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;q&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;leak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;q&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;q&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;ciph&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;pow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;flag&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;ciph&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;long_to_bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;ciph&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;ciph&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;leak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
 &lt;/code&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And we have the output of the script in &lt;code&gt;output.txt&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>